                                                "sense_id": "c4b371b0-2894-3717-b0bc-0cb2e05413ae",
                                                "text": "[…] the raking out of yesterday's fire, the kindling of to-day's under the collegiate boiler, the filling of that Spartan vessel at the pump, the sweeping and sawdusting of the common room, and other such preparations."
